  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Details: "<color=#FF9F04>Speed</color>\t\tEach 20 points of AGI adds to movement
    speed, with a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 6.\r\n<color=#FF9F04>Dodge</color>\t\tImproves
    DodgeValue, impacting dodge rate.\r\n<color=#FF9F04>AttackDelay</color> \tReduces
    attack delay by decreasing it based on AGI, clamped between 0.25 and 1.0 seconds.\r\n<color=#FF9F04>PhysicalDef</color>
    \tAGI indirectly affects physical defense values."
