    HitValue, improving accuracy.\r\n<color=#FF9F04>Range</color> \t\t\tAdds 1 to
    range for every 10 points of DEX.\r\n<color=#FF9F04>CastTimeReduction</color>
    \tLowers skill casting time by a factor dependent on DEX and INT."
